# Strategies

Full reference: `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`

## Signal convention

- Strategies emit **raw cross-sectional scores** — do NOT call `zscore_signals` inside strategies
- Analysts (`src/firm/agents/analysts/`) are the sole normalization pass

## stat_arb

- Log prices, OLS hedge ratio, Engle-Granger cointegration gate (`require_cointegration` default true)
- Net to **one signal per symbol** (no duplicate long/short from pair legs)
- Use `predefined_pairs` in `config/live.yaml` — avoid correlation mining the full universe
- Params: `strategy_params.stat_arb` in live.yaml and settings.yaml

## seasonality

- Turn-of-month (TOM) must use **trading calendar** (`pd.bdate_range`), not calendar days

## Registration

- New strategies: `@register` decorator, add to `config/live.yaml` `strategies.enabled` for live
- Both live instances read a **different** YAML (`config/live.yaml` vs `config/live_alpaca.yaml` via `FIRM_LIVE_CONFIG`) — enabling a strategy on one does not enable it on the other
- Fundamental strategies (`multi_factor`, `event_driven`) need `FMP_API_KEY` on IBKR live stack

## Known simplifications

- `event_driven`: earnings proxy, not true SUE/PEAD
- `regime_hmm`: per-symbol HMM
- `gann`: heuristic composite — permanently disabled (kept registered, not enabled in either live config)
- `ml_prediction`: permanently disabled (kept registered, not enabled in either live config)

## pattern_recognition (Strategy #13)

- Chart-pattern recognition (Lo/Mamaysky/Wang geometric framework): extrema detection → rule-based pattern detectors → scorer
- Full history/design: `docs/pattern_recognition_plan.md`
- Optional scheduled scan job + `/api/patterns/*` REST + `/patterns` frontend page
- CNN/GAF and PPO position-sizer pieces live in an isolated `.venv-ml` env (Python 3.12, `uv`-managed) — never imported by the live `firm-api` process
- Debugging: check `pattern_recognition: N symbols scanned, M signals` in the instance log (INFO level)
